# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# `Vary: Accept` is required because the Pages Functions in ../functions
# serve a text/markdown variant of some pages when the client asks for it.
# Without Vary, Cloudflare's cache could store whichever variant hit it
# first — an agent asking for markdown could be served cached HTML and
# vice versa. Accept-Encoding is included because responses vary by the
# compression negotiated upstream.
/*
  Vary: Accept, Accept-Encoding
